THIRD-PARTY DATA & SOFTWARE ATTRIBUTION:

1. Telemetry Data:
This Software retrieves public solar energy telemetry and station metadata from the SolarNetwork platform (https://solarnetwork.net). The data remains the property of SolarNetwork and/or the respective node operators, and is used in accordance with their public query protocols. Gopi Sri Krishna Yarlagadda claims no ownership over the raw public telemetry data itself.

